<title>POLAND: KRAKCHEMIA 96 NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>KRAKCHEMIA 96 NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.26 vs   0.37</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.47 vs   0.57</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.63 vs   0.70</p>
<p> Sales		   14.03 vs  11.87</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.05 vs   0.38</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.84 vs   1.09</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.49 vs   3.12</p>
<p> Sales		  130.05 vs  96.82</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish wholesaler is Firma Handlowa</p>
<p>Krakchemia SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
